   "derivation": "verify-sphincs prints verified for the stub's signature over the key and message, so AG-5 accepts, AG-6 admits T, and the node relays nothing (SF-6). Sent again alone, T is known (FP-2). T2 replaces T with the same dependency, now proven (AG-6), and a 10 percent bump; it is admitted over eth_sendRawTransaction and still relayed to no peer (SF-6). T3 replaces T2 the same way from peer p1: admitted, relayed to no one, and ignored rather than accepted under gossipsub, which would forward it (SF-7)."
